msgstr "Neteja del que el paquet ja no conté"

#: includes/import-admin.php:40
msgid "Finishing"
msgstr "Finalització"

#: includes/import-admin.php:61
msgid ""
"Brings the works, exhibitions, commissioned projects, What’s Color? and the "
"About and Color Chart pages in from the bundle prepared from the site’s "
"dataset. Entries already here are brought up to date; entries edited in "
"WordPress since the last import are left as they are."
msgstr ""
"Importa les obres, les exposicions, els projectes per encàrrec, What’s "
"Color? i les pàgines About i Color Chart des del paquet preparat a partir de "
"les dades del lloc. Les entrades que ja hi són s’actualitzen; les que s’han "
"editat a WordPress des de l’última importació es deixen tal com estan."

#. translators: %s: the folder on the server where the bundle goes.
#: includes/import-admin.php:67
#, php-format
msgid ""
"No bundle found. Upload the import folder by SFTP so that its manifest.json "
"is at %s, then come back to this page."
msgstr ""
"No s’ha trobat cap paquet. Puja la carpeta d’importació per SFTP de manera "
"que el seu manifest.json quedi a %s, i després torna a aquesta pàgina."

#: includes/import-admin.php:71
msgid "The bundle"
msgstr "El paquet"

#: includes/import-admin.php:74
msgid "Prepared on"
msgstr "Preparat el"

#: includes/import-admin.php:78
msgid "What’s Color? editions and people"
msgstr "Edicions i persones de What’s Color?"

#: includes/import-admin.php:79
msgid "Pictures in the bundle"
msgstr "Imatges del paquet"

#: includes/import-admin.php:80
msgid "Last import"
msgstr "Última importació"

#: includes/import-admin.php:80
msgid "never"
msgstr "mai"

#: includes/import-admin.php:85
msgid ""
"An import was stopped, and the bundle has been replaced since. Start the "
"import again: it brings everything up to date and skips nothing."
msgstr ""
"Es va aturar una importació i, des de llavors, s’ha substituït el paquet. "
"Torna a començar la importació: ho actualitza tot i no se salta res."

#. translators: 1: the step it stopped at, 2: how far into that step.
#: includes/import-admin.php:92
#, php-format
msgid ""
"An import stopped at “%1$s” (%2$d done). Continue it, or start again from "
"the beginning."
msgstr ""
"Una importació es va aturar a «%1$s» (n’havia fet %2$d). Continua-la o torna "
"a començar des del principi."

#: includes/import-admin.php:99
msgid "Also overwrite entries edited in WordPress since the last import"
msgstr ""
"Sobreescriu també les entrades editades a WordPress des de l’última "
"importació"

#: includes/import-admin.php:100
msgid ""
"Applies when starting again; a continued import keeps the choice it was "
"started with."
msgstr ""
"S’aplica en tornar a començar; una importació que es continua manté l’opció "
"amb què es va començar."

#: includes/import-admin.php:103 includes/import-admin.php:202
msgid "Continue the import"
msgstr "Continua la importació"

#: includes/import-admin.php:104
msgid "Start again"
msgstr "Torna a començar"

#: includes/import-admin.php:106
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Importa"

#: includes/import-admin.php:114
msgid ""
"Keep this page open until it says the import is complete. It takes a few "
"minutes the first time, while every picture is resized."
msgstr ""
"Mantén aquesta pàgina oberta fins que digui que la importació s’ha "
"completat. La primera vegada triga uns minuts, mentre es redimensionen totes "
"les imatges."

#: includes/import-admin.php:131
msgid "Only an administrator can import."
msgstr "Només un administrador pot importar."

#: includes/import-admin.php:135
msgid "No bundle found."
msgstr "No s’ha trobat cap paquet."

#: includes/import-admin.php:155
msgid ""
"The bundle has been replaced since this import began. Start the import again."
msgstr ""
"El paquet s’ha substituït des que va començar aquesta importació. Torna a "
"començar la importació."

#: includes/import-admin.php:156
msgid "There is no import to continue. Start a new one."
msgstr "No hi ha cap importació per continuar. Comença’n una de nova."

#: includes/import-admin.php:200
msgid "The import is complete."
msgstr "La importació s’ha completat."

#: includes/import-admin.php:201
msgid ""
"The import stopped: the server did not answer. Press “Continue the import” "
"to carry on from where it stopped."
msgstr ""
"La importació s’ha aturat: el servidor no ha respost. Prem «Continua la "
"importació» per seguir des d’on s’ha aturat."

#: includes/import-admin.php:203
msgid "Starting…"
msgstr "S’està iniciant…"

